{"c":[{"name":"20261017T135752Z-8f76ec9421650d2c","text":"Claude Code 2.1.302 shell-form hooks: \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}\" is expanded by the shell from the env, not pasted as text (a $ in the path survives), so hooks/claude-hooks.json is safe from path re-parsing. Skill text is pasted raw.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261017T143558Z-05746a642d0f531d","text":"sr-initialize Step 2 owner (round 3): default plugins dirs by path; elsewhere a cache-shaped copy is claude if Claude's data dir is <copy root>/data/<id> or installed_plugins.json lists it, dev if data dir is stockroom-inline, cursor via CURSOR_PLUGIN_ROOT, else ask.","type":"note"}]}
